            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-lg transition overflow-hidden fade-up">
                <img src="/images/selfpriming1.jpg" alt="Self Priming Pump" class="w-full object-contain">
                <div class="p-4">
                    <h3>Self Priming Pump</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">A Self Priming Pump is a type of centrifugal pump designed to automatically remove air from the suction line and pump casing to establish a flow of liquid without the need for manual priming.</p>
                    <a href="/products/self-priming" class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-medium hover:underline">Learn More →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-lg transition overflow-hidden fade-up">
                <img src="/images/horizontalsubmersible.png" alt="Horizontal Submersible Pump" class="w-full h-48 object-contain">
                <div class="p-4">
                    <h3>Horizontal Submersible Pump</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">A Horizontal Submersible Pump is a type of pump designed to operate while being fully submerged in water.</p>
                    <a href="/products/horizontal-submersible" class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-medium hover:underline">Learn More →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-lg transition overflow-hidden fade-up">
                <img src="/images/verticalsubmersible.webp" class="w-full h-48 object-contain">
                <div class="p-4">
                    <h3>Verticle Submersible Pump</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">A Vertical Submersible Pump is a type of pump designed to operate while being completely submerged in the liquid it is pumping.</p>
                    <a href="/products/vertical-submersible" class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-medium hover:underline">Learn More →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-lg transition overflow-hidden fade-up">
