                <div class="p-4">
                    <h3>Pressure Pump</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">Pressure Pump is a device designed to increase the pressure of water in a plumbing system, ensuring adequate water flow and pressure for household or commercial use.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-medium hover:underline">Learn More →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
