                <div class="p-4">
                    <h3>Centrifugal Pump</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">Centrifugal Pump is a machine that uses rotation to impart velocity to a liquid, which is then converted into flow.</p>
                    <a href="/products/centrifugal" class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-medium hover:underline">Learn More →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
