                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-blue-700 mb-1">Deburring</h3>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-gray-600 sapce-y-1">
                        <li>For removing burrs and sharp edges from non-ferrous impellers, deburring process is done.</li>
                        <li>Due to this we get better finishing of impeller, less wear and tear, improved life of impeller and better performance!</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-6 items-start fade-up">
                <img src="https://imgs.search.brave.com/7p_q8IpSxb0KlnC-ZKKOAD8R8NI3RCJalNueSeVZeo0/rs:fit:860:0:0:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly90NC5m/dGNkbi5uZXQvanBn/LzEyLzI5LzQ5Lzk5/LzM2MF9GXzEyMjk0/OTk5OTJfUmhkb0Q4/SENqRmdWVVVTdlJS/SzJISENTT29hWGdk/R20uanBn" alt="Grinding" class="w-28 h-28 object-cover rounded shadow">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-blue-700 mb-1">Grinding</h3>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-gray-600 sapce-y-1">
                        <li>Grinding of rotor shaft is done after final machining of the rotor.</li>
                        <li>Due to this, runout of rotor shaft is minimized which inturn helps in reducing wear and tear of shaft-bush assembly!</li>
                        <li>It also increases the surface finish of the rotor shaft.</li>
                    </ul>
