                    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-gray-600 sapce-y-1">
                        <li>We utilize shell core to make brass impellers which gives much better finishing than core box-pattern type impellers.</li>
                        <li>Due to this, we achieve better finish of impeller, improved discharge and head of pump, along with increased life of impeller due to reduction in wear and tear!</li>
