                    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-gray-600 sapce-y-1">
                        <li>Components like impeller and rotor shaft, which require precision machining is done with CNC machine.</li>
                        <li>Due to this, we achieve accurate dimensions of the component which intern helps increasing the efficiency as well as life of the product!</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-6 items-start fade-up">
                <img src="https://imgs.search.brave.com/gcxlM_xZcEV-senvd9ocPqFb9tCmD8CqJ2wvX0Xfsio/rs:fit:860:0:0:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9jZG4x/MS5iaWdjb21tZXJj/ZS5jb20vcy1lNzdl/NC9pbWFnZXMvc3Rl/bmNpbC8zMDB4MzAw/L3Byb2R1Y3RzLzc1/MDMvNjMxMzQvQnVj/a2xlZ3V5X0xlYXRo/ZXJfQnVybmlzaGlu/Z19NYWNoaW5lX18y/ODU3Ni4xNzE1NjA3/MzE1LmpwZz9jPTI" alt="Burnishing" class="w-28 h-28 object-cover rounded shadow">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-blue-700 mb-1">Burnishing</h3>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-gray-600 sapce-y-1">
                        <li>After rotor grinding is done, burnishing process is done on rotor shaft.</li>
                        <li>Due to this, rotor shaft bush surface becomes super finished which inturn reduces friction between shaft and bush increasing the life of both components!</li>
                        <li>It also helps to move the pump freely.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-6 items-start fade-up">
                <img src="https://imgs.search.brave.com/aEI4tq-f5OgGpUuNuS21EfjLxGGlv6FO7GOfp96UIWw/rs:fit:860:0:0:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9jZG4u/cGl4YWJheS5jb20v/cGhvdG8vMjAxNy8w/My8wMS8xNy81MS9j/cnVjaWJsZS0yMTA5/MjAyXzY0MC5qcGc" alt="In house Foundry" class="w-28 h-28 object-cover rounded shadow">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-blue-700 mb-1">In house Foundry</h3>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-gray-600 sapce-y-1">
                        <li>In house Foundry for non ferrous metals like HTB1, LTB4 & GM.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
